# command: /root/diagnostics --test-pacing-dma-delay
=== TX DMA TIMING TEST ===
Measures how long write_buffer/push() actually blocks.

Configured rate: 3840000 Hz (FIR: false)
Expected: ~85ms per push (4096 samples at 48 kHz effective rate)
If push takes <1ms, the FIFO is overflowing.

